ts/steam/apps/2075340/extras/b2da727a9ebd8e8bceec82c57328a804.avif?t=1752929193\" data-has-big /></div>- Goblin - We are the true children of Maeve. In the darkness, we do his bidding and from sunlight we hide. We trick, we lie and we find precious things for our Lord. She hates us and she loves us. Our existence makes as much sense as she wills it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
